                    {
                                 'n': '20.9',
                                 't': 'Tax implications of business restructuring — section 189 of NTA',
                                 'b': [
                                                          {
                                                                                'p': 'Section 189 of the NTA sets out the tax implications of business '
                                                                                     'restructuring in three distinct cases — a **merger** of two or '
                                                                                     'more trades or businesses, a **sale or transfer that causes '
                                                                                     'cessation** of a trade or business, and a **sale or transfer of a '
                                                                                     'single business asset that does not cause cessation**.',
                                                                              },
                                                          {
                                                                                'h4': '(a)  In the case of a merger of two or more trades or businesses',
                                                                              },
                                                          {
                                                                                'ol': [
                                                                                                                    'a **new trade or business shall not be deemed to have '
                                                                                                                    'commenced** as a result of the merger, and the provisions of '
                                                                                                                    'the Act relating to **cessation** of trade or business shall '
                                                                                                                    '**not apply** to the trade or business that ceased as a result '
                                                                                                                    'of the merger;',
                                                                                                                    'the provisions of Part VIII of Chapter Two of the Act — '
                                                                                                                    'ascertainment of chargeable gains — as they relate to '
                                                                                                                    'chargeable gains shall **not apply** to the assets transferred '
                                                                                                                    'to the new or surviving trade or business as a result of the '
                                                                                                                    'merger;',
                                                                                                                    'assets of the merging trades or businesses shall be deemed to '
                                                                                                                    'have been transferred at the **residue of the qualifying '
                                                                                                                    'capital expenditure** on the day following the merger;',
                                                                                                                    'the provisions of the First Schedule (capital allowance) shall '
                                                                                                                    'apply on the **remaining useful life** of the asset transferred '
                                                                                                                    'because of the merger;',
                                                                                                                    '**unutilised capital allowance** on the assets transferred '
                                                                                                                    '**shall be available** for the use of the new or surviving '
                                                                                                                    'trade or business;',
                                                                                                                    '**unabsorbed losses** of the merging entities **shall be '
                                                                                                                    'available** to the surviving trade or business, provided that '
                                                                                                                    'such losses were incurred by the merged trade or business; and',
                                                                                                                    '**taxes deducted at source** in respect of the merged trades or '
                                                                                                                    'businesses **shall be available** to the merged trade or '
                                                                                                                    'business.',
                                                                                                                  ],
                                                                              },
                                                          {
                                                                                'h4': '(b)  In the case of a sale or transfer of a trade or business '
                                                                                      'which results in the cessation of a trade or business',
                                                                              },
                                                          {
                                                                                'ol': [
                                                                                                                    'the provisions of Part V of Chapter Two of the Act as regards '
                                                                                                                    '**cessation** of trade, business, profession or vocation '
                                                                                                                    '**shall apply** to the trade or business that was sold or '
                                                                                                                    'transferred;',
                                                                                                                    'for the purposes of the First Schedule (capital allowance), the '
                                                                                                                    'asset sold or transferred shall be recognised **at the value at '
                                                                                                                    'which it is sold or transferred**;',
                                                                                                                    '**unutilised capital allowance** on the assets sold or '
                                                                                                                    'transferred **shall not be available** for use in the new or '
                                                                                                                    'surviving trade or business;',
                                                                                                                    '**unabsorbed losses** of the old business **shall not be '
                                                                                                                    'available** for use in the new or surviving trade, business, '
                                                                                                                    'profession or vocation; and',
                                                                                                                    '**taxes deducted at source** from the old trade or business '
                                                                                                                    '**shall not be available** for use by the new or surviving '
                                                                                                                    'trade or business.',
                                                                                                                  ],
                                                                              },
                                                          {
                                                                                'h4': '(c)  In the case of a sale or transfer of a business asset which '
                                                                                      'does not result in the cessation of the trade or business',
                                                                              },
                                                          {
                                                                                'p': 'Where the parties agreed to sell or transfer the asset for an '
                                                                                     'amount **not exceeding the sum of the residue of the qualifying '
                                                                                     'capital expenditure and the unutilised capital allowance** of the '
                                                                                     'asset:',
                                                                              },
                                                          {
                                                                                'ol': [
                                                                                                                    'capital allowance under the First Schedule shall apply to the '
                                                                                                                    '**residue of the asset only**;',
                                                                                                                    'the **unutilised capital allowance** on the asset sold or '
                                                                                                                    'transferred **shall be available for use by the buying** trade '
                                                                                                                    'or business;',
                                                                                                                    'the trade or business that sold or transferred the asset '
                                                                                                                    '**shall not claim any part** of the unutilised capital '
                                                                                                                    'allowance pertaining to it; and',
                                                                                                                    'the provisions of Part VIII of Chapter Two as regards '
                                                                                                                    '**chargeable gains shall not apply** to the asset sold or '
                                                                                                                    'transferred under this paragraph.',
                                                                                                                  ],
                                                                              },
                                                          {
                                                                                'key': 'The organising question is **whether tax history travels with '
                                                                                       'the business**. On a **merger** it does — no cessation, no '
                                                                                       'chargeable gains, assets carried over at tax written-down value, '
                                                                                       'and unutilised capital allowances, unabsorbed losses and '
                                                                                       'withholding tax credits all pass to the survivor. On a **sale or '
                                                                                       'transfer causing cessation** it does not — cessation rules '
                                                                                       'apply, assets are recognised at sale value, and allowances, '
                                                                                       'losses and WHT credits are all lost. On a **sale of one asset '
                                                                                       'with the business continuing**, the position is intermediate: no '
                                                                                       'chargeable gain, and the unutilised allowance follows the asset '
                                                                                       'to the **buyer**, with the seller claiming none.',
                                                                              },
                                                          {
                                                                                'note': 'Do not confuse this with the **VAT** treatment of business '
                                                                                        'restructuring at §7.29, which is a separate provision of the '
                                                                                        'same section 189 dealing with whether a transfer of assets on a '
                                                                                        'restructuring is a taxable supply. The rules above are the '
                                                                                        '**income tax** consequences, and the two must be applied '
                                                                                        'independently to the same transaction.',
                                                                              },
                                                        ],
                               },
